
////////////////Cinematic - Intro//////////////////
//SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil001
//"Thranduil: Our sentinels report the Enemy is preparing their assault. War rages to the South and many of our wilder kin have found themselves north of the River."
//END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil032
"Thranduil: The horror of Mordor has left a shadow in my heart. Its memory dims the light of the sun. \n I have ever known that it would return."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil033
"Thranduil: For such is the nature of evil. In time, all foul things crawl forth... But I will not idly await its coming."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil034
"Thranduil: While the shadow gathers upon the marches of my Kingdom, we have come to meet it. \n We will beat back the forces of Mordor, and avert the fiery ruin they seek to inflict upon us!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil029
"Thranduil: Our sentinels report the Enemy is preparing their assault."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil030
"Thranduil: War rages to the South..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil031
"Thranduil: ...and many of our wilder kin have taken refuge north of the River."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil002
"Thranduil: They are not alone. Bands of Woodmen have been sighted travelling in these woods, \n likely seeking our aid in the defence of their homes."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil003
"Thranduil: We must gather them to bolster our defences."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel001
"Tauriel: I will go at once, my King."
END

////////////////Cinematic - River//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_mountedscout000
"Scout: My King! The Enemy is near! The forest burns!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren024
"Feren: We shall make Mordor pay for this incursion!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil004
"Thranduil: Take up positions! We will not yield an inch of our Realm!"
END

////////////////Cinematic - Council//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil019
"Thranduil: The broodmother has fled. But I fear this is not the last we will see of her."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast002
"Radagast: They will not stop coming unless we root them out at their source."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast003
"Radagast: Saenathra makes her lair not far from here. Those fell warrens \n are narrow, and filled with her spawn. Her vile toxins drift all around."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil020
"Thranduil: I will not risk what forces we have. We shall clear it out ere we march them through."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast004
"Radagast: The Orcs come from further south, where the Lieutenant of Dol Guldur has set up his war camp."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil016
"Thranduil: Then let us strike while we have the advantage. We cannot allow the Enemy time to reorder his forces."
END

////////////////Cinematic - Gwanthaur//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_khamul002
"Khamul: Your victory may seem near, but you have forgotten \n about the one who lurks in the dark places... among the blackness of the oldest boughs..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil025
"Thranduil: It cannot be..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel045
"Tauriel: What is this creature!?"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel047
"Tauriel: Twisted roots... a visage of death!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren019
"Feren: It is the Gwanthaur!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil026
"Thranduil: We cannot fall back. Elves ready yourselves, we kill it here!"
END

////////////////Cinematic - Stag//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren022
"Feren: It cannot be killed!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil027
"We will not cower to this evil! Here we make our final stand!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast009
"Radagast: Look! We are not alone!"
END

////////////////Cinematic - Outro//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast010
"Radagast: This is not the last of them. So long as the old fortress on the Hill of Sorcery remains, \n Greenwood the Great will not be cleansed, and you will not be free of the Dark Lord's memory."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil028
"Thranduil: I do not possess the power to bring that place to ruin. Its evil is too great..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast011
"Radagast: There is one who does. In time, she will make her way from the Golden Wood to here. \n Stay vigilant, King Thranduil! This war is not over..."
END

////////////////FOREST - ALLIES//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel002
"Our allies are scattered in the forest. If we do not find them quickly they will be forever lost. We cannot tarry!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel003
"My friends, the Enemy has come. We are in need of your aid!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel004
"Our lands are under assault. Will you aid us?"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel005
"The Enemy burns all in his path. Join us, Ithilrim!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel006
"You are far from home, Woodmen. The Elvenking will protect you."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel007
"Elves and Men must stand together in the face of this threat!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel008
"We will help you!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel009
"Look there! Our kin needs our aid!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel010
"There, the Enemy seeks to overwhelm them!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel011
"We must reach them, hurry!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel012
"They are surrounded!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel013
"Stand and fight!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel014
"Begone fell creatures!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel015
"It isn't safe here! Come with us!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel020
"We were too late to save them."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel021
"They did not make it out alive."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel022
"Our allies... we were too late to save them."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel023
"They're gone. our efforts were in vain."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel024
"We have failed them..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel025
"With each casualty, our chances of victory grow slimmer."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel026
"The loss of our kin weakens our defences."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel027
"We are running out of time. We must find our allies soon!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel028
"The Enemy draws near. We cannot tarry here!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel029
"We have gathered many, but our kin are still out there. We must find them!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel030
"Excellent! Our full strength is gathered!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel031
"There is no time left. We must return to King Thranduil!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel032
"Come. We must return to King Thranduil!"
END

////////////////RIVER//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel018
"We cannot allow them to fester..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel019
"The Enemy has entered here!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel033
"Archers take up ambush positions! We can strike at the orcs before they reach open grounds."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel034
"Feren! Be careful!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel035
"Watch out, my King!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel036
"They are swarming!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel037
"Do not let them surround us!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel038
"We must stand fast!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel039
"Hold your positions!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel040
"Put an end to these foul creatures!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel041
"Aim for the archers!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel042
"You shall regret coming here!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel043
"Take heart! We will not fall here!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel044
"Return to the Shadow, foul creatures!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren001
"Elves, we must strike out now and establish our defences."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren002
"The Enemy will seek to take control of the river fords. It is here that we must halt their advance."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren003
"We will not allow a single orc to cross the river!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren004
"The Enemy draws near and our defences are not ready! We must reinforce the crossings!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren005
"It is done!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren006
"Tauriel needs our aid!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren007
"Defend the Elvenking!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren008
"They are crossing the River!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren009
"Throw them back across the water!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren010
"Do not yield your positions!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren011
"They threaten to overrun us!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren012
"Strike them down, one by one!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren013
"They cannot be allowed to enter here!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren014
"Cleanse the valley of this wicked brood!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren015
"Look out! More are coming!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren023
"We cannot hold them! We must retreat!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil005
"The fell horde approaches. Elves, stand firm and do not falter!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil006
"Stand together, do not falter! For the Woodland Realm!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil007
"We deal with them here!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil008
"Show them no mercy!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil011
"They have doomed themselves!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil012
"Follow your King!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil013
"To battle, Elves of the Woodland Realm!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil014
"Aiwendil! Your aid is most welcome! Help us throw them back across the river!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil015
"Our enemies have fallen. Their assault has failed."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn001
"Let none survive!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn002
"I will crush this vile orc myself!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn003
"Bring them to me!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast001
"Forth, my friends! Let us be rid of this wickedness!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_elf038
"Our fallen allies!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_elf039
"We could have saved them all... now they have risen against us!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saenathra006
"The nerve! Slay them, sisters!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_saenathra007
"No... no... we were promised... so much more..."
END

SCRIPT:Hint_Waystone01
"Use Waystones to teleport units between crossings, or bring reinforcements from the camp."
END

////////////////SPIDERS//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel016
"This place reeks of filth..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel017
"They skitter all around..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast005
"Be careful! These mists are a malevolent poison..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast007
"Our Enemy is well defended. We will need our full strength to break through."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast008
"A foul mockery of life!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast012
"We've made safe a path. Summon your forces, King Thranduil, and let us end this."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil017
"That wretched spider is dead."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil018
"We must gather our forces and march upon their stronghold!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saenathra001
"Squirm all you like... you cannot stop this infestation!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_saenathra002
"Come to my lair, little creatures... my sisters and I await you!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_saenathra003
"Foolish elflings, to disturb the home of Shelob's spawn..."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_saenathra004
"The eggs! Hah... hardly an inconvenience... we will make more!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_saenathra005
"We have had enough of your meddling. Come, my sisters! We feast on elfling tonight!"
END

////////////////DOL GULDUR//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_radagast006
"They have been twisted to the Dark Lord's will!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren016
"Forward elves!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren017
"Charge their positions!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren018
"For the Woodland Realm!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren020
"Stand fast elves! Do not waver!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_feren021
"They are a twisted mockery! Cut them down!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil009
"Destroy their fortifications!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil010
"Burn their wretched hovels!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil022
"Come, let us march upon their camp and root out this evil once and for all."
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil023
"Your time has come, servant of darkness!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_thranduil024
"Stand fast! Do not give in to fear!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn004
"Destroy those towers!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn005
"Beornings, with me!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn006
"Stomp them into the earth!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn007
"They can't hold us back!"
END
SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn008
"They must be destroyed!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_khamul001
"A lesser Elf-lord, a mangy skinchanger, and a middling magician. \n You believe that mastery of this forest is yours? The Eye of Sauron is upon me! \n I am empowered by his Will!"
END

////////////////GWANTHAUR//////////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_tauriel046
"It is a nightmare!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbeorn009
"The beast's strength is waning!"
END

